          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>\"I LOVE THE WATERMELON BLAST, IT'S MADE ME BRUSH FOR LONGER AND MY MOUTH FEELS MUCH MORE REFRESHED AFTER THAN USING A COLGATE MINT TOOTHPASTE!\"<\/p>",
