    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Fresh burst of flavours daily to make brushing more enjoyable<br\/><br\/>✔ More concentrated ingredients to support a cleaner, brighter smile<br\/><br\/>✔ Helps support daily oral care routines<br\/><br\/>✔ Perfect for adults & children<br\/><br\/>✔ Safe & natural ingredients for peace of <br\/>mind<br\/><br\/>✔ Fluoride formula to support enamel and smile care<br\/><br\/>✔ Variety of 8+ burstful flavours to choose from<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes our toothpaste different?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Indulge in the luxurious experience of Smile Therapy's Flavoured Toothpaste. It's not just a quick brush; it's a daily treat for your teeth. Our Fluoride+ formula supports multi-layered care — helping to maintain a brighter-looking smile, soothe the mouth, and elevate your daily oral care ritual.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Flavoured Toothpaste consists of:<\/p><ul><li>1x Premium Box Packaging<\/li><li>1x Flavoured Toothpaste (of your choice)<\/li><li>When you buy the bundle, you'll get a taste of every flavour!<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Aqua (Water), Sorbitol, Hydrated Silica,<br\/>Xylitol, Glycerin, Aroma (Flavour), Disodium Phosphate, Sodium Lauroyl Sarcosinate, Calcium Glycerophosphate, Benzyl Alcohol, Caprylyl Glycol, Sucralose, Menthol, Sodium Fluoride, Sodium Gluconate, Pentylene Glycol, Zinc Lactate, Menthyl Diisopropyl Propionamide, Benzoic Acid.<\/p><p>Contains: Sodium fluoride 0.243% W\/W (eq. 1100 ppm f.)<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>1. Avoid Ingestion:<\/strong> While our toothpaste is tasty, it's important not to swallow it. Rinse thoroughly after brushing.<\/p><p><strong>2. Quantity:<\/strong> Use only a pea-sized amount of toothpaste for effective cleaning. Using too much can lead to excessive foaming or unnecessary waste.<\/p><p><strong>3. Storage:<\/strong> Store the toothpaste in a cool, dry place and keep the cap tightly closed to prevent drying or contamination.<\/p><p><strong>4. Children Under 2:<\/strong> Consult a dentist before using flavored toothpaste on children under the age of 2.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_KKYEnU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Flavoured Toothpaste be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Flavoured Toothpaste is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. It is carefully formulated to be gentle on all types of dental work while effectively cleaning your teeth. The toothpaste provides a refreshing taste and helps maintain overall oral hygiene, ensuring your natural teeth and dental restorations stay clean and protected.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
